// Azure Monitor / Log Analytics Forensic Telemetry Query
// Domain: Real-Time Security: Autonomous Fraud Velocity Interception on Azure Event Hubs
AzureDiagnostics
| where TimeGenerated >= ago(24h)
| summarize TotalEvaluations = count(), Refusals = countif(ResultType != "Success") by bin(TimeGenerated, 15m), Resource
| order by TimeGenerated desc
